rf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Potter County runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those 75 years. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids got 27% of normal in January to February and 85% in June to July. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 29821 at 42% of normal that year.</p>"}
